Subject: [linux-user-app-lifetime] Keep user launch paths and lifetime outside the private worker

The host supplies only original user directory values and cwd through inherited
environment context. All launch paths share null stdio, a separate process group,
and removal of private Cua variables. Desktop discovery reads the same user roots.

